      "duration_ms": 0.0,
      "explain": "Graph RAG finds a completely different entry point than embedding-based retrieval: instead of measuring semantic similarity between a query vector and chunk vectors, it matches literal entity mentions in the question against the pre-built knowledge graph's vocabulary to jump straight to a set of graph nodes. This is a pure string-matching heuristic with no LLM call \u2014 the corpus was already mined for entities and relations offline when the graph was built.",
